<title>POLAND: Ocean launches PLN 20 mln CP programme.</title>
<headline>Ocean launches PLN 20 mln CP programme.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trading company Ocean SA launched a 20 million zloty ($7.2 million) commercial paper scheme, issuing the first tranche of 5.0 million zlotys, the company said.</p>
<p>The programme is managed by Polish state-owned bank Pekao SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 ($ = 2.792 Polish Zloty)</p>
